<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN IN SHARJAH CUP MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT PAKISTAN IN SHARJAH CUP MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Pakistan by 51 runs in their Sharjah Cup cricket match on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 251-7 in 50 overs, Pakistan 200 all out in 45.4 overs.</p>
</text>
